      "LILY: I'm good.\nNINA: Should I go again?",
      "VERONICA: Your idea of a joke?\nVERONICA: Fuck you.\nNINA SAYERS: Stunned, she turns around to face the mass of ballerinas.",
      "ERICA: My daughter, the Swan Queen.\nNINA: Oh, mom.\nERICA: It's our favorite, vanilla with strawberry filling.\nNINA: Just a little piece."
    ]
